 🥧 Happy Thursday — Thanksgiving is a week away. Smart Brevity™ count: 1,990 words ... 7½ mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 🪖 Our Future of Defense Summit in D.C. kicks off today at 1:45 p.m. ET. Guests include Boeing Defense CEO Steve Parker, House Foreign Affairs ranking member Rep. Gregory Meeks (D-N.Y.), Sen. Joni Ernst (R-Iowa) &amp; more. Watch here . 

 💰 Situational awareness: Anthropic (ticker: ANT) is expected to start trading today after pricing its long-awaited IPO at $83 a share, Axios' Madison Mills and Dan Primack write. 

 The company and its co-founders raised $81 billion in the largest IPO ever. Go deeper ... Anthropic's announcement . 
 
